13. wa#-ar#-ka-tam ap-ru-us2-ma _a-sza3_ sza i-ti-ru 
#tr.ts: warkatam aprusma eqlim ša itīrū 
#tr.en: The circumstances I investigated, (and) the fields that they added, 
